WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.471
I wanna ask questions about...

2
00:00:13.972 --> 00:00:17.100
what happened within the family
that brought you to therapy.

3
00:00:24.942 --> 00:00:28.022
You know.
I don't know. I come from a. a murderer.

4
00:00:32.908 --> 00:00:34.618
You know. who would...

5
00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:38.455
who the fuck would accept me?

6
00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:45.754
Uh. so what else do you need to know?

7
