is to talk about my dad.

8
00:00:56.014 --> 00:00:59.977
My dad... was a great dad.

9
00:01:01.436 --> 00:01:05.274
Are you my babies?
Are you my babies? Huh?

10
00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:11.029
Growing up. I felt like he and I
